    <bpmn:process id="W_W4308" name="W4308. Haul-Away Reverse Logistics, Consolidation &amp; Vendor Scrap Partner" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Hauled units at DC/store ready for consolidation
Frequency: Periodic consolidation runs
Volume: Consolidated hauled-unit volume to recyclers
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Reverse Logistics / DC Ops (VS-04) / 3PL (VS-56)
Participants: DC Ops (VS-04), Store Ops (VS-07), Reverse Logistics (VS-32), Scrap/Recycler Vendor, 3PL (VS-56), Finance (VS-17.4)
Source: workflow W4308 — Haul-Away Reverse Logistics, Consolidation &amp; Vendor Scrap Partner</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4308_LaneSet4">
