    <bpmn:process id="W_W4311" name="W4311. Bulky Reverse-Logistics Asset Recovery, Refurb/Open-Box &amp; Liquidation" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Hauled unit or customer-return assessed as refurb/resale-eligible
Frequency: Continuous assessment + periodic liquidation
Volume: Refurb/resale-eligible units (subset of hauled-away + VS-32 returns)
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Reverse Logistics / Reverse (VS-32) / Clearance (VS-64)
Participants: Reverse Logistics (VS-32), Quality (VS-31), Refurb Partner, Clearance (VS-64), Finance (VS-17.4), LP (VS-23)
Source: workflow W4311 — Bulky Reverse-Logistics Asset Recovery, Refurb/Open-Box &amp; Liquidation</bpmn:documentation>
