      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4311_Task5" name="Reverse Logistics/Quality assess each candidate unit for refurb/resale…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Reverse Logistics/Quality assess each candidate unit for refurb/resale eligibility (cosmetic vs functional, safety, warranty/legality of resale, data-bearing clearing VS-91) per VS-32.3
Responsible (R): Reverse Logistics / Quality
Accountable (A): Service Mgr
Duration: Per unit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4311_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4311_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4311_Task6" name="Reverse Logistics route eligible units — in-house/partner refurb…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Reverse Logistics route eligible units — in-house/partner refurb, certified-refurb relabel, open-box liquidation via VS-64 channels, or parts-harvest — and price for recovery
Responsible (R): Reverse Logistics / Clearance
Accountable (A): Service Mgr
Duration: Per unit</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4311_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4311_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4311_Task7" name="Finance/LP track recovery vs scrap-baseline, ensure resale compliance (refurb…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Finance/LP track recovery vs scrap-baseline, ensure resale compliance (refurb disclosure, no resale of unsafe/counterfeit), and prevent leak/diversion
Responsible (R): Finance / LP
Accountable (A): CFO / LP Lead
Duration: Periodic</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4311_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4311_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4311_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4311_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4311_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-661 (ensure controlled execution — Haul-Away, Old-Unit Recycling, Reverse Logistics &amp; Analytics (PA-143.3).) | - CTL-661: refurb safety-assessed &amp; disclosed; recovery tracked; LP-monitored (VS-23); data cleared (VS-91)
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Reverse Logistics / Reverse (VS-32) / Clearance (VS-64)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
