    <bpmn:process id="W_W4312" name="W4312. Bulky Delivery/Install/Recycle Program Performance &amp; Sustainability Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Quarterly/annual program review; sustainability report
Frequency: Quarterly + annual
Volume: Enterprise program performance + sustainability outcome
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Operations / Sustainability (VS-25) / Finance (VS-17.4)
Participants: Commercial (VS-01), CX (VS-13), Finance (VS-17.4), Sustainability (VS-25), HSE (VS-24), Strategy (VS-33)
Source: workflow W4312 — Bulky Delivery/Install/Recycle Program Performance &amp; Sustainability Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4312_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4312_Lane1" name="Delivery Ops">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4312_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4312_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4312_Lane2" name="Commercial">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4312_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W4312_Lane3" name="Sustainability">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4312_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4312_End9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4312_Start5" name="Quarterly/annual program review; sustainability report">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4312_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4312_Task6" name="Delivery Ops/Analytics consolidate program KPIs — on-time-window %…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Delivery Ops/Analytics consolidate program KPIs — on-time-window %, first-time-success %, install-complete %, damage %, haul-away completion %, recovery $/unit, landfill-diversion tonnes, CO₂e avoided, customer NPS
Responsible (R): Delivery Ops / Sustainability / Finance
Accountable (A): Head of Bulky Delivery / Sustainability Lead
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4312_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4312_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4312_Task7" name="Commercial/Strategy benchmark vs cost-to-serve and competitor offering…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Commercial/Strategy benchmark vs cost-to-serve and competitor offering, identify improvement (capacity, install quality, recovery), and prioritize actions
Responsible (R): Commercial / Strategy / Delivery Ops
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4312_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4312_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4312_Task8" name="Sustainability/Leadership report the bulky circular-economy outcome…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability/Leadership report the bulky circular-economy outcome (haul-away→recycle→refurb) into the ESG/sustainability narrative (VS-25) and board assurance (VS-36/VS-21)
Responsible (R): Sustainability / Leadership
Accountable (A): Sustainability Lead / CFO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4312_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4312_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4312_End9" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4312_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
