        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-661 (ensure controlled execution — Haul-Away, Old-Unit Recycling, Reverse Logistics &amp; Analytics (PA-143.3).) | - CTL-661: program KPIs reviewed quarterly; improvement actions prioritized; ESG outcome reported (VS-25)
Owner: Bulky-Delivery Operations / Sustainability (VS-25) / Finance (VS-17.4)</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
